# Luminarch Aspirant cast on turn 1 triggers as that combat begins and puts a +1/+1 counter on itself: its only legal
# target, so Bot1 is not asked. It does not trigger on Bot2's turn. On turn 3 it triggers again, and Bot1 targets the Mother of Runes cast that turn instead, so each
# creature ends with one counter. The trailing wait lets the second trigger resolve before the state is checked.

